# Navigation — Event Management System

This document defines the navigation structure of the Event Management System for each user role.

---

## 1. Common Navigation

All users first access the system through authentication.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Application] --> B[Login]
    B --> C{Authentication Successful?}

    C -->|Yes| D[Role-Based Dashboard]
    C -->|No| B

    D --> E[User-Specific Navigation]
    E --> F[Profile]
    E --> G[Notifications]
    E --> H[Logout]

    H --> B
```

