# 9. Navigation Rules

1. Users must log in before accessing protected pages.
2. The dashboard is displayed according to the user's role.
3. Users can only access navigation items permitted for their role.
4. Participants can browse events and create bookings.
5. Organizers can create and manage their events.
6. Staff or volunteers can verify tickets and record attendance.
7. Organization Managers can monitor events, bookings, reports, and analytics.
8. Administrators have system-level management access.
9. Users can access their profile and notifications from their respective dashboards.
10. Users can log out from the system at any time.

